<title>JAPAN: Ujiie to become new Nomura president -- Jiji.</title>
<headline>Ujiie to become new Nomura president -- Jiji.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nomura Securities Co Ltd managing director Junichi Ujiie will replace Masahi Suzuki as the brokerage's president, Jiji news service said on Tuesday.</p>
</text>
